{"synopsis":"50 tahun setelah dunia game menyatu dengan kenyataan, seorang pejuang terhebat muncul.\n\nIa mendedikasikan seluruh hidupnya untuk dunia tersebut, namun akhirnya dibunuh oleh sang raja karena rasa takut dan iri hati.\n\nSebelum kematiannya, ia membangkitkan kemampuan cermin dan menyegel jiwanya di bawah permukaan danau.\n\nSang raja menutupi sejarah yang sebenarnya dan menciptakan sejarah palsu, mencap sang pejuang sebagai pengkhianat di mata dunia.\n\nPuluhan tahun kemudian, sang pejuang terbangun dalam tubuh seorang pria sekarat dan memulai balas dendamnya dengan menggunakan kemampuan cermin.","alternative_title":"重生后我用镜面反转复仇","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"260b6120-a1a6-4ff1-b61e-b9f97fb44579","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01"},{"chapter_id":"fb06c8cc-a781-4ca6-97a8-1d9194e0e414","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29"},{"chapter_id":"55846fb6-1ddb-47b5-aa25-013db352d086","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"","date":"2026-07-12","released":"2026-07-12"},{"chapter_id":"32c3498e-7846-4716-a507-911bf5fce42d","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2026-06-14","released":"2026-06-14"},{"chapter_id":"7c5befbb-e3be-45cf-a082-1efc178aa2fc","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2026-06-04","released":"2026-06-04"},{"chapter_id":"fd65a0e7-9645-4873-9a33-0483816d8952","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"","date":"2026-06-04","released":"2026-06-04"},{"chapter_id":"14a9248b-1dc8-407e-81f5-425420e84807","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"","date":"2026-06-04","released":"2026-06-04"},{"chapter_id":"813a7ef8-b2b9-46bc-b115-58ab3125f01c","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"","date":"2026-06-04","released":"2026-06-04"},{"chapter_id":"23071f32-ce1a-4426-ad31-bf8da4f41686","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"","date":"2026-06-04","released":"2026-06-04"},{"chapter_id":"9ccb1b3d-b8f2-4829-8a4c-856b0acb0d29","nu